al work* (The Quietus, Groove).[6][12][14]  \n  - Minimal as *“diminutive, simple artistic expression”* and *“place of solitude”*; rhythm-within-rhythm and trance.[2]  \n  - Naming of minimal and the idea of *“access-authorized repetition.”*[3]\n\n- **Basic Channel / Rhythm & Sound**  \n  - Editorial framing of Basic Channel as inventing minimal techno and Rhythm & Sound as *“explor[ing] the spaces beyond the bassline.”*[8]  \n  - Process-based philosophy: *“The sound dictates the concept.”*[7]  \n  - Critical descriptions of repetition and dub as a “place”, and cyclical structure.[9][11]\n\nIf you tell me whether this is for an article, academic paper, or liner notes, I can help you stitch these specific quotes into a clean analytical argument and suggest how to balance artist statements vs critical discourse.","refusal":null,"reasoning":null,"annotations":[{"type":"url_citation","url_citation":{"url":"https://ra.co/reviews/25097","title":"Rewind: Robert Hood - Minimal Nation · Album Review ⟋ RA","start_index":0,"end_index":0}},{"type":"url_citation","url_citation":{"url":"https://www.theskinny.co.uk/clubs/interviews/rhythm-roots-and-spirituality-connecting-the-dots-with-robert-hood","title":"Robert Hood | M-Print | Interview | The Skinny","start_index":0,"end_index":0}},{"type":"url_citation","url_citation":{"url":"https://www.gridface.com/robert-hood-interview/","title":"Robert Hood: In the Spirit - Gridface","start_index":0,"end_index":0}},{"type":"url_citation","url_citation":{"url":"https://jaegeroslo.no/ae-selects-robert-hood-minimal-nation/","title":"Selects: Robert Hood – Minimal Nation - Jaeger Oslo","start_index":0,"end_index":0}},{"type":"url_citation","url_citation":{"url":"https://selector.news/2021/07/01/robert-hood-minimal-nation-reissue/","title":"Robert Hood's 1994 Album, Minimal Nation, to be Reissued as ...","start_index":0,"end_index":0}},{"type":"url_citation","url_citation":{"url":"https://thequietus.com/interviews/robert-hood-interview-floorp